# Members of the gnome group that are never downloaded, one per line with the
# condition they are left out under. Anything another member actually depends
# on still arrives as a dependency.
#
# always      every desktop install
# slim        only with the slim desktop
# no-flatpak  only without Flatpak, which it depends on
#
# The browser is a question of its own, and the browser task installs the one
# that was chosen - GNOME Web among them.
always epiphany
no-flatpak malcontent
slim gnome-calendar
slim gnome-maps
slim gnome-contacts
slim gnome-font-viewer
slim gnome-characters
slim gnome-clocks
slim gnome-connections
slim gnome-music
slim gnome-weather
slim gnome-calculator
slim gnome-logs
slim gnome-text-editor
slim gnome-disk-utility
slim simple-scan
slim baobab
slim snapshot
slim loupe
slim decibels
slim showtime
slim papers
